### Implementation Sequence

1. Add i18n keys to both language files (simplest, no dependencies)
2. Add CSS to all three stylesheets (can be done in parallel, no runtime dependencies)
3. Implement Tables tab search in `Sidebar.tsx` (inline, self-contained)
4. Implement Skills tab search in `SkillsPanel.tsx` (self-contained)
5. Implement Memories tab search in `MemoriesPanel.tsx` (self-contained)
6. Manual testing: verify each tab's search works, verify clear-on-toggle, verify i18n in both languages

Steps 3, 4, and 5 are independent and can be done in any order.

